    "equipment": "Mark 3–4 one-way lanes, 2–3 metres wide, a waiting zone behind the start line, and a ball station outside the lanes.\nSetup: 5 minutes. Pack-down: 3 minutes.\nOrganisation: pairs; one performs and one observes, 5–8 students per lane, one ball per pair.",
