    "unitContribution": "Motor: coordination, balance, control, and accuracy.\nSocial: communication, turn-taking, and support.\nCognitive: observation, decision, and self-regulation.\nTactical: use of space, support, and transition.\nEmotional: confidence, persistence, and recovery after error.",
