    "equipment": "Detail: One ball per pair/trio; four cones per square; one defender bib per group.\nSetup: 6 minutes before class.\nPack-down: 4 minutes after class with assigned equipment teams.\nRecommended organization: Five or six 6×6 metre squares with 1.5-metre walkways; 4–5 students per square. On half court, use 5×5 metre squares and rotate groups.",
