    "teacherSummary": "Basketball 06 connects moving reception with a simple choice.\nStudents scan before catching and identify an open or closed lane.\nOpen leads to dribble; closed leads to a support pass.\nUse controlled shadow defense and no contact.\nSuccess: 4/5 criteria in six of eight situations.",
